msgstr "Нажмите 'Создать черновик нового релиза'"

#: ../../contribute/core/releases.rst:138
msgid "Enter the version"
msgstr "Введите версию"

#: ../../contribute/core/releases.rst:139
msgid ""
"Select the correct branch (eg 1.12 for a 1.12.x release, 2.3 for a 2.3.x "
